---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={"Dialogos Terms of Service - PiFl Labs"}
  description={"Terms of Service for the Dialogos app by PiFl Labs — AI philosophical dialogue, subscriptions (Dialogos Pro), and disclaimers."}
  canonical="https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/dialogos/terms/"
  alternates={[{"hreflang":"en","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/dialogos/terms/"},{"hreflang":"ko","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/dialogos/terms/"},{"hreflang":"ja","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ja/apps/dialogos/terms/"},{"hreflang":"x-default","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/dialogos/terms/"}]}
  extraCss={["/styles.css"]}
>
    <section class="legal-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/en/apps/dialogos/" class="legal-back"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Dialogos</a>
            <h1><i class="fas fa-file-contract"></i> <span class="text-gradient">Dialogos Terms of Service</span></h1>
            <p class="legal-date">Effective date: June 14, 2026 · Provider: PiFl Labs</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main class="legal-page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="legal-card">
                <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
                <p>By downloading or using Dialogos you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the app.</p>

                <h2>2. What Dialogos is — and is not</h2>
                <p>Dialogos generates <strong>AI-written philosophical dialogue</strong> in the voice of ancient Stoic thinkers, grounded in public-domain source ideas, for reflection and education. <strong>It is not professional medical, psychological, legal, or financial advice, and it is not a substitute for a qualified professional.</strong> AI responses may be inaccurate or incomplete; do not rely on them as the sole basis for any important decision. <strong>If you are in crisis or may harm yourself or others, contact emergency services or a professional helpline immediately</strong> (the app lists local resources under Settings → Disclaimer &amp; Crisis Resources).</p>

                <h2>3. Eligibility</h2>
                <p>You must be at least 13 years old (or the minimum digital-consent age in your country) to use the app.</p>

                <h2>4. Subscriptions (Dialogos Pro)</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Dialogos Pro is an <strong>auto-renewable subscription</strong> offered as a monthly or annual plan. The current price is shown in the app, localized by the store.</li>
                    <li>Payment is charged to your Apple ID or Google account at confirmation of purchase.</li>
                    <li><strong>The subscription renews automatically</strong> unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account is charged for renewal within 24 hours before the period ends.</li>
                    <li>You can manage or cancel your subscription in your Apple ID / Google Play account settings after purchase. Deleting the app does not cancel a subscription.</li>
                    <li>Refunds are handled by Apple/Google per their policies and applicable law.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>5. Free tier and fair use</h2>
                <p>The free tier provides a limited number of messages per day. We enforce server-side usage limits to keep the service sustainable and may adjust limits to prevent abuse.</p>

                <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
                <p>Do not use the app for unlawful purposes, to attempt to extract or misuse the underlying AI, to overwhelm the service, or to generate content that is illegal or harmful. We may rate-limit or restrict access to protect the service.</p>

                <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
                <p>The app, its design, and its software are owned by PiFl Labs. Mentor replies are AI-generated paraphrases of <strong>public-domain</strong> source ideas with attributions; they are provided for your personal, non-commercial reflection. You retain ownership of the text you input.</p>

                <h2>8. Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
                <p>The app is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, PiFl Labs is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the app, including reliance on AI-generated content.</p>

                <h2>9. Changes</h2>
                <p>We may update the app and these Terms. Material changes will be surfaced in the app; continued use constitutes acceptance.</p>

                <h2>10. Governing law</h2>
                <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Korea, without regard to conflict-of-laws rules, except where mandatory local consumer law applies.</p>

                <h2>11. Contact</h2>
                <p>Questions: <a href="#" data-email-user="support" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
